   "level": 3,
   "text": "What is proof?"
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "md": "- Proof is a series of logical steps which show whether a result is **true** or not for a set of specified numbers\n\n  - e.g. All integers, all even numbers etc"
  },
